== GET /sse
status 200
| event: endpoint / data: /messages/?session_id=<sid>
== init POST
status 202
| Accepted
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"capabilities":{"prompts":{"listChanged":false},"resources":{"listChanged":false,"subscribe":false},"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","serverInfo":{"name":"http-demo","version":""}}}
== initialized POST
status 202
| Accepted
== call POST
status 202
| Accepted
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"content":[{"text":"11","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"structuredContent":{"result":11}}}
== slow POST
status 202
| Accepted
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/progress","params":{"progressToken":9,"progress":1,"total":1}}
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/message","params":{"level":"info","data":"step 1"}}
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"result":{"content":[{"text":"done 1","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"structuredContent":{"result":"done 1"}}}
== touch POST
status 202
| Accepted
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/resources/updated","params":{"uri":"note://a"}}
| event: message / data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"result":{"content":[{"text":"touched note://a","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"structuredContent":{"result":"touched note://a"}}}
== no session_id
status 400
| session_id is required
== bad session_id
status 400
| Invalid session ID
== unknown session_id
status 404
| Could not find session
== bad body
status 400
| Could not parse message
== text body
status 400
| Invalid Content-Type header
== GET messages
status 405
allow: POST
== POST /sse
status 405
allow: GET, HEAD
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
| Method Not Allowed
== evil host /sse
status 421
| Invalid Host header
== other
status 404
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
| Not Found
